{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>And they shall make for themselves tassels.</b> It is possible in two interpretations, the first being that they shall make tassels like \"the tassels of their heads,\" and they are the threads that protrude and are not woven:" "<b>On the corners of their garments.</b> On every garment, tunic or trousers, for if you divide it, it is in the shape of a corner." "<b>A thread of tekhelet.</b> On the tassel. And the meaning of <b>tekhelet</b> is because it is like the appearance of the sky."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:51.370618293Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}